# Sales & Business Growth Analysis

## Project Overview
An end-to-end Business Analyst portfolio project analysing sales performance across products, categories, regions, sales representatives and months using Excel, SQL and Power BI.

## Business Objectives
- Measure revenue, cost, profit, profit margin, transactions and units sold.
- Compare performance by product, region, category and sales representative.
- Analyse monthly trends and month-over-month revenue growth.
- Explore the relationship between discounts and profitability.
- Present results in an interactive Power BI dashboard.

## Tools
- WPS Spreadsheets / Microsoft Excel
- MySQL-compatible SQL
- Microsoft Power BI Desktop

## Dataset
The training dataset contains 40 illustrative transactions from January to May 2026. Cost is estimated using a 70% assumption and should not be treated as audited cost data.

## Analysis
### Excel
Calculated revenue, cost and profit; built KPI, product, region, sales representative and monthly summaries; created charts.

### SQL
Prepared queries for validation, overall KPIs, product/region/representative analysis, monthly trends, month-over-month growth and discount profitability review.

### Power BI
Built DAX measures, KPI cards, trend and comparison visuals, a month-region matrix, and Month/Region/Product slicers.

## Key Validation
- Transaction records: 40
- Monthly transaction counts: Jan 7, Feb 7, Mar 7, Apr 8, May 11

## Important Assumptions
Cost is modelled at 70% of gross unit value. Replace with actual cost data for real business decisions.

